Z||000000||Fiero_24||10-19-2001||08:20 AM||||Tonight I am on my way to WI with my new performance engine.  I am going to take a few things off the motor tonight, but I am mainly soaking the cradle bolts down to help take them out.  I am going to work all day Saturday, and Sunday too.  I will try to post pics as soon as possible first thing next week.  I had the short block assembled and balanced to save a little time, so as long as I can get the cradle off I should be fine.  Wish me luck, I will need all the luck I can get!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||10
Z||000001||KissMySSFiero||10-19-2001||08:26 AM||||Good luck.  Im kinda in the same boat.  I just bought a truck for daily driving.  4x4 s10.  now im going to start a v8 swap.  hopefully done by Dells next year.  good luck to you too. =Þ<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <BR>88FORMULA<BR>       <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>        <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fiero_24||10-19-2001||02:34 PM||||Well if all goes well it will be on the Road Sunday night.  I am not going to put it on the highway right away.  My dad is going to drive it around for a week to help break it in for me.  Good luck with the V8 swap, that will be my next motor swap.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
